  <p>
    <strong>Key Takeaway:</strong> Understanding gravity evolved from ancient philosophy through Newton's universal
    law to Einstein's curved spacetime, with each theory encompassing and extending its predecessor. The story
    continues today with gravitational wave astronomy, quantum gravity research, and mysteries like dark matter.
    This progression shows how science builds upon previous work while remaining open to revolutionary new insights.
  </p>
